;Created for catalysis-toolkit offline fixtures.
 Metallic molybdenum, bcc Im-3m.
 Cell parameter a = 3.1470 A from common room-temperature reference data
 (IMOA/WebElements tabulate metallic Mo as bcc with a about 3.147 A).
;

